msgstr "Permissions insuffisantes"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1157
#: templates/admin-status-health.php:228
msgid "No provider is connected, so there is no connection to check."
msgstr ""
"Aucun fournisseur n'est connecté, il n'y a donc aucune connexion à vérifier."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1188
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1647
msgid "Stored Credentials Unreadable"
msgstr "Identifiants enregistrés illisibles"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1189
msgid ""
"Sync is paused because the saved cloud credentials cannot be decrypted. This"
" is not the same as \"never configured\" — the cloud provider details are "
"still in the database, but the WordPress salts changed since they were saved"
" (commonly after restoring a database from a different environment)."
msgstr ""
"La synchronisation est en pause car les identifiants cloud enregistrés ne "
"peuvent pas être déchiffrés. Ce n'est pas la même chose que « jamais "
"configuré » : les informations du fournisseur sont toujours en base, mais "
"les salts WordPress ont changé depuis leur enregistrement (souvent après la "
"restauration d'une base venant d'un autre environnement)."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1190
msgid ""
"Re-enter the credentials in Cloud Provider › Credentials. Everything else "
"(provider selection, container name, sync state) is preserved."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez à nouveau les identifiants dans Fournisseur cloud › Identifiants. "
"Tout le reste (fournisseur choisi, nom du conteneur, état de la "
"synchronisation) est conservé."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1193
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1649
#: templates/admin-overview.php:116 templates/admin-status-health.php:153
msgid "Re-enter Credentials"
msgstr "Saisir à nouveau les identifiants"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1202
msgid "Sync & Offloading Not Available"
msgstr "Synchronisation et offloading indisponibles"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1203
msgid "Connect a cloud provider in Cloud Provider › Connection first."
msgstr "Connectez d'abord un fournisseur dans Fournisseur cloud › Connexion."

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1206
#: templates/admin-overview.php:429
msgid "Go to Cloud Provider"
msgstr "Aller au fournisseur cloud"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1212
msgid "Steps to Enable Sync"
msgstr "Étapes pour activer la synchronisation"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1214
msgid "Go to Cloud Provider › Connection"
msgstr "Aller à Fournisseur cloud › Connexion"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1215
msgid "Configure your cloud storage provider"
msgstr "Configurez votre fournisseur de stockage cloud"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1216
msgid "Test the connection"
msgstr "Testez la connexion"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1217
msgid "Save your configuration"
msgstr "Enregistrez votre configuration"

#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1218
msgid "Return to this screen to sync files"
msgstr "Revenez sur cet écran pour synchroniser les fichiers"

#. translators: 1: the storage service (e.g. Amazon S3), 2: the name of the
#. bucket
#: includes/class-diluxone-offload-admin.php:1317
#, php-format
